        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Norman Borlaug\n- Movements: Green Revolution\n- Plants: Onobrychis viciifolia, alfalfa, clover\n- Books: The Frankenfood Myth\n- Awards: Nobel Peace Prize\n\nFacts:\n- Norman Borlaug, the author of the foreword in The Frankenfood Myth, was an American agronomist.\n- Norman Borlaug worked on the Green Revolution.\n- Norman Borlaug won the Nobel Peace Prize in 1970.\n- During the Green Revolution, Onobrychis viciifolia was replaced by high-yielding alfalfa and clover species.",
